    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7416728179714953216",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7416728179714953216/",
    "text": "Thanks for the grat writeup Adam Parry! And for taking the time to cover my career journey and experience. It’s always interesting to see your work reflected back like that.\n\nWhat I enjoy most is helping businesses get from zero to one, weaving together technology, product, messaging, storytelling, and commercial execution. \n\nI’ve had the chance to work with some genuinely great startups, helping them translate complex innovation into clear narratives, viable products, and real-world outcomes.\n\nReading this was also a good reminder of how much experience I’ve picked up along the way. \n\nI’m going to start sharing more posts on lessons learned and practical advice from that journey, rather than just hyping up AI like I always do 🤣",
