    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7398310953085448192/",
    "text": "Gemini's new Nano Banana is insane! Download your LinkedIn profile as a PDF and ask it to make an illustrative infographic-style journey of your career. Here's mine: \n\nThe implications for this kind of technology are quite incredible. It means anyone can be as good as a reasonably decent graphic designer. \n\nIs it as good as the absolute very best? No, of course not, but not everyone needs that all the time. This si more than good enough for most situations.. \n\nNow we have a simple way of making boring, complicated and long reports and documents made visual in less than a minute with one prompt. \n\nI've seen some incredible examples of using vibe coding tools like Lovable or Perplexity. By uploading a bunch of industry reports, it turns into an interactive website dashboard. It's just so much easier to consume the information.",
