    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7333102592127897601/",
    "text": "I'm extremely proud to call the UAE my home - this is just another example of how forward-thinking this country is - every citizen now gets free access to ChatPGT Plus. Amazing.\n\nThis will literally increase the productivity of the entire country - how smart is that! \n\nRecently, a new directive came out that AI must be taught in all schools - a fantastic step to making sure students are prepared for an AI-powered future.\n\nUAE is also at the forefront of regulation with VARA the Virtual Assets Regulation Authority which has a comprehensive set of rules and regulations for operating digital asset and RWA businesses within the country in a safe and compliant matter.\n\nThis is an amazing step forward to let businesses grow while other countries are still bickering back and forward or just slowing things down with regulation.\n\nIt's fantastic to see such forward-thinking from a government for their citizens, and I can't wait to see what's next.",
