    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7300019263317098497",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7300019263317098497/",
    "text": "Yesterday I spoke at the AIBC World (AI, Blockchain & Crypto) conference - organised by Olga Yaroshevsky - on a panel with Ibrahim Wazneh, Daniel Robbins and Rola Diab. \n\nIt was interesting hearing so much discussion and enthusiasm all day about AI Agents - it's clear that the tides are turning.\n\nMarketing agencies and professionals are embracing AI agents to automate the mundane and have more time for more person-to-person contact.\n\nWhile a question to the audience gave a surprising number of people who believe marketers will be one day replaced completely - I still think the human element will be central for a long time to come.\n\nThanks to Olga and the panellists for the interesting discussion!",
