    "text": "Last week I was privileged to be on The Crypto Radio to talk about AI and the intersection with Web3, and for some reason AI Girlfriends 😆 \n\nIf you have not seen it already - The Crypto Radio is an awesome online radio station streaming crypto-related shows and interviews 24/7 - I highly recommend listening.\n\nThey have had some amazing guests and its a great way to increase your knowledge whether you are new to web3 or want to hear the latest views from some of Web3's most prominent people.\n\nThanks for having me Justin Harper and Thierry Bouchard!",
