    "text": "🚀 GriffinAI’s Roadmap is Live – The Future of On-Chain AI is Here! \n \nGriffinAI is on a mission to redefine how AI operates in the Web3 world. Our newly released roadmap lays out the foundation for what’s next – and if you’re even remotely interested in AI, blockchain, or where these two collide, this is something you don’t want to miss. \n \nWe’re not just building another AI platform. GriffinAI is the only dedicated on-chain AI network designed specifically for Web3. Our AI agents aren’t just passive data tools – they research, execute transactions, and automate complex workflows directly on the blockchain. This is the next evolution – AI that doesn’t just answer questions but takes action. \n \n🔹 What to Expect from the Roadmap: \n • AI Agents That Work for You: Fully autonomous agents capable of managing DeFi, governance, and beyond. \n • Developer Ecosystem: Tools to let anyone deploy custom AI agents to handle Web3 tasks. \n • Seamless UX for Web3: We’re eliminating the learning curve for blockchain – imagine interacting with Web3 as easily as using ChatGPT. \n \nThis is AI as a copilot for Web3, and if you’ve been following the shift from ‘text-to-answer’ to ‘text-to-action,’ you already know how big this is. \n \n🔗 Read the roadmap – we’re just getting started. \n \nhttps://lnkd.in/eAtFfFwK",
