    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7267447057102114819",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7267447057102114819/",
    "text": "This is absolutely remarkable: a set of \nhashtag\n#AIAgents that can essentially replace a team of skilled consultants. The business of intellectual work is about to get a serious shakeup.\n\nMeet \nhashtag\n#ContextAutopilot. It thinks, learns, and uses tools just like you do. It plugs into a company dataset - collates and verifies everything and conducts new research to output extremely impressive work.\n\nIt collaborates on files just like a digital coworker. It uses its context engine to have a true understanding of the entire body of ingested knowledge - a current weakness of current LLM's.\n\nSwarms of AI \nhashtag\n#Agents constantly crawl your dataset, proactively develop novel insights, and deliver cutting-edge intelligence.\n\nNow, this is just a demo video - what the real product will be like remains to be seen. \n\nIt's natural to be sceptical of the real quality of its output - but it doesn't matter. The writing is on the wall. This is going to happen sooner or later.\n\nThink about what this will mean. Small businesses will now have almost the power of a 'Big 4' Consultancy - for $49 a month.\n\nWe will have an 'AI Coworker' who can give us a massive boost in productivity and quality of output to anyone.\n\nDisruption is coming.\n\nBut fear not - those who adapt and utilise these tools will have a massive advantage.\n\nStay ahead, because 99% of people won't.",
    "date": "1 year ago",
    "likes": 142,
    "comments": 33,
    "impressions": 13355,
    "_debug": ""
