    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7265693544122580994/",
    "text": "Do you use a Virtual Assistant? You should. I'm sharing my list of VA's I've used over the years that have massively helped me be more productive and spend more time on what's most important.\n\nEveryone nowadays has too much to do and not enough time - but often the things that need to be done are tedious, repetitive and boring.\n\nAs a founder or entrepreneur, or anyone working on a startup or in web3 - you juggle so many things and wear so many hats, very often you need to spend a lot of time on low-value tasks - but they have to be done.\n\nMy advice is have a VA who can take these low value tasks off your plate allowing you more time to work on what's most important.\n\nYou can also use them to do things you know you'd never get around to do - but for a very small amount of money they can get done!\n\nOver the years I've found a small army of assistants to help me with everything from research, booking flights, demand generation, graphic design, websites and video.\n\nI'm sharing my team so save this document and reach out if you need help. I've used most of them and can recommend them - so give them a shout if you need help.\n\nThey have been great for me so this is my way of giving back to help them get more clients, I hope you find them as useful as I have!\n\n Link to the list of VAs : https://lnkd.in/g6vs7Wwj",
