    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7258392139691102208/",
    "text": "Here is the link for the \"ChatGPT Search - Chrome Extension\" - Install this and try it. Will this be the Google Search Killer?...\n\nThis Chrome extension means when you search in the Chrome search bar, instead of getting the results in Google, you now get the answers in ChatGPT.\n\nIt's surprisingly quick and well laid out - will take a bit of getting used to but so far I like it. You can still bounce to the websites to see for yourself but it actually understands what you are asking and tries to give you that summary.\n\nI hardly use Google anymore. When I have a question, I don’t want a list of possible websites to sift through—I just want the answer. ChatGPT gives me that directly. \n\nIs it always perfect? No, but it’s accurate enough to make it worthwhile.\n\nIt will be interesting to see how this pans out. Google will have to counter with Gemini giving you more answers and fewer search results and ads.\n\nBut when millions depend on SEO and ads via Google, what happens when businesses can no longer effectively market online?\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/ekeUyQtu",
