    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7255139690427699200/",
    "text": "Have you ever seen a technology advance so fast, to such a high degree of quality, than \nhashtag\n#AIVideo?\n\nHere are two new examples: \n\nThe first is Act-One by Runway where you can easily map your facial expressions to those of an animated character. (Video Credit Arminas Valunas) \n\nThe 2nd is a Mochi 1, the new state-of-the-art video animation model - which is open source! \n\nTechnology that is this advanced that is practically free!\n\nThe rate at which these models are staggering.\n\nIn a few years, kids will be making animated movies in their bedroom that previously would have taken a $100m budget to achieve.",
