    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7234099496463278081/",
    "text": "So excited to be speaking at the AI Crypto Summit in Seoul Korea next week alongside some of the industry's top leaders!\n\nReally looking forward to some fascinating discussions around the intersection of \nhashtag\n#Web3 and \nhashtag\n#AI with some of the best companies in the ecosystem.\n\nIf anyone in my network will be at \nhashtag\n#koreanblockchainweek and would like to come to the \nhashtag\n#aicryptosummit - please give me a shout!",
