    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7209489581488902144",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7209489581488902144/",
    "text": "AI Agents are going to be the next revolutionary development in tech - here is another early example. Meet Jace by getviktor.com - it can book holidays, start companies and act as a recruiter - and that's just the beginning.\n\nWe are about to see a flood of \nhashtag\n#AIagents appear and their capabilities while basic now, will be advancing rapidly.\n\nWith \nhashtag\n#Jace, you give it a goal and it will list the steps and complete them one by one, using your browser, apps and personal details.\n\nDoes this mean we'll never have to fill out endless forms again? Fingers crossed, but I hope it will be much more than that.\n\nThese AI Agents will do your research, your admin and complete tasks for you. Allowing you to focus on the important stuff and not the boring drudgery and repetitive tasks.\n\nIn one of their other demos it starts a company and find a paying client... Just imagine in a few years what it will be able to do.\n\nAs I always say it will be like having a team of really smart personal assistants - but that's just the beginning - they are marketing it as a 'digital employee'.\n\nThe naysayers will always say it will be limited and never be able to do real work... Just wait. We're on the exponential scale now, the rate of improvement accelerates.\n\nI can't wait until I just have to tell my AI Agents what to do while I sit by the pool drinking cocktails.\n\nThat's how it's going to be, isn't it??",
    "date": "1 year ago",
