    "text": "It's monday morning and prepare to have your mind blown 🤯 Here is Reid Hoffman, founder of LinkedIn, having a conversation with his AI video clone.\n\nThis is absolutely remarkable - and remember how early we are, so this is only going to get significantly better, very quickly.\n\nAs I've been saying for ages, soon we are all going to have AI friends to chat to for help on anything we can imagine.\n\nMy buddy Mike Chatterton has some fantastic calls on this - you'll soon have Einstein or Richard Branson as your personal mentor - not only advising but doing the work too.\n\nThe AI Agents are coming. I'm so excited!!",
