    "text": "An anonymous person nicknamed \"Mr 100\" has been buying at least 100x \nhashtag\n#bitcoin every day for several months. They now have 52,000 Bitcoin at a value of $3.6 Billion dollars.\n\nWhat does this guy know that you don't?\n\nThere's a lot of speculation as to who is behind this, very few people in the world have this ability. \n\nA Saudi Billionaire perhaps? Maybe.\n\nOr a nation state? Probably more likely.\n\nEither way, so many people are asking me if they should buy Bitcoin now and they are worried that this may be the top.\n\nWell, this guy has been buying the top all along and he's risking billions.\n\nIt's probably nothing.",
