    "text": "🤖 Robots can now talk! 🗣 Figure just put ChatGPT into their Figure01 bot - you can ask it to answer questions or complete tasks.\n\nRight now the lag is quite noticeable and sadly this really ruins the wow factor of what a momentous moment this is.\n\nI'd love to see them use Groq whose answers are under 400ms - at that rate it's indistinguishable and can be perfectly humanlike.\n\nIt seems crazy now, but in just a few, years having conversations with \nhashtag\n#robots will be commonplace.",
