    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7123628079649804288",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7123628079649804288/",
    "text": "I'm taking my first proper holiday in I can't remember how long, where I intend to completely disconnect from work for 2 weeks and get a well needed de-stress and recharge.\n\nWhether working in startups, being an entrepreneur or a consultant, it really is a never ending list of work and it's so hard to resist temptation to reply to that email or jump on that call.\n\nInstead I plan to spend time with my wife and son, do some sightseeing, see some friends, swim, surf and drink a lot of beer by the pool 🍻 \n\nBut I do plan to read, listen to podcasts and watch some videos that I might not normally be able to find the time for, so please hit me up with any links you recommend and I'd love to check them out. 💡 \n\nI'll still post on LinkedIn because that I really enjoy and I find it relaxing but I might try to change my style a little. \n\nNow I have more time to think about topics, read and research, and maybe try out some new ai tools too! \n\nOK maybe I'm not really completely disconnecting 🤔 😂\n\n\nhashtag\n#holidays \n\nhashtag\n#srilanka",
    "date": "2 years ago",
    "likes": 111,
    "comments": 45,
    "impressions": 0,
    "_debug": ""
