    "text": "So happy to be recognized as a 'Top Voice' in Artificial Intelligence by LinkedIn! 🎉 😁 🚀 \n\nI've been writing for just over 6 months, driven by nothing more than that I really enjoy sharing my thoughts and insights with the community on my passion for AI.\n\nThe journey has now opened up some fantastic opportunities. I'm getting invited onto podcasts & webinars and even to speak at events. \n\nCompanies are now reaching out requesting training for their teams - and I'm being asked to deliver C-suite briefings to educate them on what the future holds and how they can utilise AI for their business.\n\nI've always loved presenting and training - so I feel very fortunate that now I get to combine several passions and talents together do what I really love.\n\nNow I've teamed up with an amazing bunch of industry experts with a huge amount of experience offering comprehensive AI solutions to businesses of all sizes.\n\nIf you're interested in how we can assist your business in navigating the world of AI, please don't hesitate to reach out.\n\n\nhashtag\n#topvoiceai",
