    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7113509482822840321",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7113509482822840321/",
    "text": "WOW!! Meta just announced AI Personalities!! This, is going to be the Next Big Thing!!! 🚀 💡 \n\nI've been saying this for a while - in a few years we will look back and laugh at how we use AI as a soulless and static ChatGPT text box.\n\nCurrently you get the same generic clinical answer from a faceless AI. Now personalities are here and you can ask different 'people' your answer to get different views and opinions in their unique style. Just like you would with humans.\n\nGet music recommendations form Snoop Dogg, Fashion advice from Paris Hilton - or chat about sports with Tom Brady.\n\nThis is really only the beginning and the possibilities are endless. The age of Digital Humans is upon us - and it's come even faster than I anticipated. \n\nThe rate of advancement of all of this is simply astonishing.\n\nYounger generations always adopt and drive new tech. We recently saw Snapchat putting an AI Chatbot right in the app and this is going to be the norm.\n\nNow Meta will have it inside Instagram, Whatsapp and Facebook. They will be omnipresent and soon we won't know how we ever lived without it.\n\nI'm really excited to see how this plays out..\n\n\nhashtag\n#digitalhumans\n\nhashtag\n#aichatbots\n\nhashtag\n#artificialintelligence",
