    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7107740848368365568",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7107740848368365568/",
    "text": "This is what NFT's should be all about!!! 🔥 Someone just took out a million dollar loan 💰 secured using a collection of Supreme Tshirts as collateral - using an NFT.\n\nForget about extremely expensive animal cartoon pictures, NFT's are amazing technology that enables on chain smart contracts with a virtual stranger, using the power of a trustless system.\n\nNFT's have unfortunately got somewhat of a bad rep and the market collapsed this year, but I still believe in the power of the technology into the future for solidifying value of digital assets - or in this case real world transactions in an immutable way - ultimately redefining how we perceive ownership and value in the digital age.\n\n\nhashtag\n#nfts\n\nhashtag\n#digitalassets",
    "date": "2 years ago",
    "likes": 39,
    "comments": 26,
    "impressions": 0,
    "_debug": ""
