    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7092159247739740160/",
    "text": "I use many AI tools on a daily basis, but here's one I would recommend to absolutely everyone: 💡 💯 ⭐ 🚀 \n\nIt's called \"ChatGPT Summary\" - and it's a Chrome Plugin that summarises anything on your screen in seconds - without leaving the page.\n\nMaybe you are looking at a 5,000 word article and you just want the overview - get the bullet point summary in seconds.\n\nBut for me the thing it does best is summarise youtube videos: \n\nI watch so much youtube but still can barely keep up - this means at a glance I can see what it will cover and then decide if I want to watch the full 30 or 60 minutes - and even at that reading the condensed summary at the end is extremely helpful for retention.\n\nYou can download it here: https://lnkd.in/dBP7XPeC - make sure to pin it so it appears in your icons.\n\nIf you find this useful let me know and I will share many more tools I use.\n\n\nhashtag\n#aitools\n\nhashtag\n#chatgpt\n\nhashtag\n#liweb3",
