    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7087474489910861825/",
    "text": "This is why we should be wary of CBDC's...\n\nMy fear is that in a few years, AI will result in mass unemployment, making a basic income essential. If you want the money, it will be distributed via a \nhashtag\n#cbdc - with some rules & stipulations.\n\nWhat would they be? Well, restricted usage, transaction monitoring, a social credit system, time-limited incentives, transaction taxes, capital controls or financial censorship, the list goes on.\n\nWe need \nhashtag\n#decentralisation not more control.",
