    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7074380208878854144",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7074380208878854144/",
    "text": "Bitcoin logo projected onto the ECB building in Frankfurt. I love how this says 'Study Bitcoin' and not 'Buy Bitcoin'...\n\nI first discovered Bitcoin in 2013 but like most I ignored it at first. In 2015 I was thinking to buy some but was persuaded otherwise. Finally when I properly understood it and then bought it in 2016 - I was hooked - and now more than ever I'm still learning more about it constantly to this day.\n\nI always advise people to study it, because once you understand its:\n\nFixed supply of 21 million coins\nDecentralized nature\nImmutability and security\nPermissionless and borderless transactions\nTransparency and public verification\nResistance to censorship\nStore of value \n\n..you'll see the key attributes that make Bitcoin so fascinating and revolutionary.\n\nTo learn more I recommend following these awesome bitcoiners.\n\nPeter McCormack\nAnthony \"Pomp\" Pompliano\nJason Lowery\nDr. Saifedean Ammous\nLyn Alden\nCaitlin Long\nDan Held\n\n\nhashtag\n#bitcoin \nhashtag\n#learning \nhashtag\n#blockchain",
