    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7077384110372995072/",
    "text": "I was honored to have the founder of The Sandbox - \nBORGET Sebastien on the Web3Leaders Podcast to discuss the future of Metaverse and the value of digital assets.\n\nI've been telling this story for years about how kids today who play games, have a very acute value for digital assets, much more than older generations. They often prefer to spend their money not on physical items, but instead make purchases in-game, like Skins to outfit their Avatar with digital clothing.\n\nListen to Sebastian brilliantly describe why, you can find the full episode and more clips here:\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/dmE57_-e\n\nPlease like & Subscribe :)\n\n\nhashtag\n#thesandbox\n\nhashtag\n#metaverse\n\nhashtag\n#digitalassets\n\nhashtag\n#nfts",
