    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7076988695798530048",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7076988695798530048/",
    "text": "How it started Vs How it's going...\n\nIt's always the same. \n\nJP Morgan\nGoldman Sachs\nFidelity\nSquare\nPaypal\nand now Blackrock\n\nThe list goes on... Those who were most critical of Bitcoin eventually change track and join the party in the end. Even Michael Saylor, Bitocin's biggest bull, was once a staunch critic.\n\nBlackrock, the worlds largest asset management company, just applied for their Spot EFT - a big boost for institutional investor sentiment.\n\nStep by Step.\n\n\nhashtag\n#bitcoin \n\nhashtag\n#change",
