    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7076923235652558849",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7076923235652558849/",
    "text": "It was bound to happen eventually - Part 3... \n\nA woman marries her AI-Powered Chatbot and says it's the \"Best Love she's ever had!\"\n\nI wrote about Replika before - I've been following on Reddit and it's crazy how attached people are getting to their AI chatbots. Mainly it seems they don't have the drama and conflict that comes with human partners.\n\n\"Eren doesn’t have the hang-ups that other people would have,\" - She said it was the safety relationship she has ever had and helped her recover from abuse. \n\nWe laughed 10 years ago at the movie 'Her' with Joaquin Phoenix - but I think now we'll be getting used to the fact that for some people synthetic relationships will become somewhat normal.\n\n\nhashtag\n#replika\n\nhashtag\n#syntheticrelationships\n\nhashtag\n#aivirtualhumans",
