    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7057690515458174976/",
    "text": "\"AI is like refrigeration. The people who invented refrigeration made some money, but most of the money was made by Coca-Cola, which used refrigeration to build an empire\"\n\nI love this story from Chamath Palihapitiya - his point is that AI is a platform that people will build on top of to create literally trillions in new value. \n\nIt's so exciting to be right here at what is clearly the most important technological leap ever.\n\nEvery day dozens of new tools are released, mostly by individual developers quickly hacking something together on top of chatgpt - solving a simple problem and quickly building into a multi-million dollar business.\n\nIt really is the opportunity of a lifetime for entrepreneurs \n\n\nhashtag\n#ai\n\nhashtag\n#chatgpt\n\nhashtag\n#entrepreneurship",
