    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7039248371793965056",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7039248371793965056/",
    "text": "Did you know, that when you look at an IKEA catalogue, the images you see are not actual photos - but photo-realistic digital recreations of the furniture? \n\nIt's far cheaper to build a photorealistic digital dining room or kitchen, than actually assemble all the furniture, take a picture and do that 600 times for a catalogue.\n\nNow with AI, we are beginning to be able to do this with Video. This is the evolution of \nhashtag\n#dalle2 and \nhashtag\n#midjourney - into video. Imagine the potential when this matures! \n\nThe need to film a lot of actual footage and B roll will fade away as you can just tell an AI what you want and it will create it for you!\n\nHow do you think this is going to change the world of movies and tv?\n\nEventually you'll be able to write a script, give some visual guidelines and the AI will spit out the movie for you.\n\nProbably there will be a premium paid for 'Real' video - but the cost of CGI is going down rapidly and the quality will become indistinguishable...\n\nWould you be happy to watch movies, tv and video made completely by an AI?\n\n\nhashtag\n#ai \n\nhashtag\n#aivideo\n\nhashtag\n#stablediffusion",
