    "urn": "urn:li:activity:7020787809745547264",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7020787809745547264/",
    "text": "The US debt ceiling is currently $31.381 trillion. That's $31,381,000,000,000. Humans simply cannot really comprehend a number so huge. So let's break it down...\n\nTake a guess... If I gave you a dollar every second - how long would it be before you had a million dollars? Hazard a guess before reading further...\n\n..\n\nThe answer? 11.5 days, so mid-end of next week basically.\n\nOk, now what about a Billion? What do you think? Have a guess!\n\nThe answer? 31 years! So it woudl take until 2054 you'd have a Billion. Quite the step up from next week!\n\nNow a trillion? \n\nIt's 31,709 years... <mindblown.gif>\n\nMost people really do not understand just how much money a billionaire has - we think about it as a simple step above a million. Its really hard to comprehend just how much debt the US has.\n\nBut it's cool, we'll just keep doing this, printing endless money, and everything will be fine... Right?\n\n\nhashtag\n#bitcoin",
    "date": "3 years ago",
    "likes": 0,
